WEBVTT

00:11.030 --> 00:15.780
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:11.030 --> 00:15.780
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:15.840 --> 00:20.100
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:15.950 --> 00:20.200
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:20.270 --> 00:23.890
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:20.370 --> 00:24.000
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:32.740 --> 00:36.070
<i>Since when was it?</i>

00:32.840 --> 00:36.180
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

00:36.240 --> 00:38.990
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

00:36.340 --> 00:39.100
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

00:39.160 --> 00:41.540
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

00:39.260 --> 00:41.640
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

00:41.700 --> 00:44.830
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

00:41.810 --> 00:44.940
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

00:45.000 --> 00:49.210
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

00:45.100 --> 00:49.320
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

00:50.500 --> 00:54.720
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

00:50.610 --> 00:54.820
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

00:54.880 --> 00:59.050
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

00:54.990 --> 00:59.160
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

00:59.220 --> 01:04.390
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

00:59.330 --> 01:04.500
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

01:04.560 --> 01:09.400
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

01:04.660 --> 01:09.500
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

01:09.570 --> 01:13.570
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

01:09.710 --> 01:13.670
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

01:13.740 --> 01:17.610
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

01:13.840 --> 01:17.720
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

01:17.780 --> 01:22.700
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

01:17.890 --> 01:22.810
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

01:22.870 --> 01:27.670
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

01:22.970 --> 01:27.770
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

01:27.830 --> 01:31.420
<i>And dream my dream</i>

01:27.940 --> 01:31.520
<i>yume wo miru</i>

01:31.590 --> 01:33.760
<i>And know my dream</i>

01:31.690 --> 01:33.860
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

01:42.260 --> 01:50.440
THE ROMOS MARTIAL ARTS TOURNAMENT

01:54.820 --> 01:58.780
It's the balloon!
The balloon has returned!

02:08.870 --> 02:10.420
We're back!

02:10.750 --> 02:12.190
Princess!

02:12.190 --> 02:15.220
Where has she been this whole time?

02:15.220 --> 02:18.050
And she's brought more members.

02:21.720 --> 02:25.700
Princess Leona, as the princess
of a country, you must behave--

02:25.700 --> 02:29.110
Gather the key figures
of our country at once.

02:29.110 --> 02:30.790
Huh?! Uh...

02:30.790 --> 02:33.460
Time is of the essence. Hurry!

02:33.460 --> 02:34.630
Princess!

02:35.570 --> 02:37.490
Huh? What's going on?

02:37.490 --> 02:38.580
Leona!

02:38.580 --> 02:39.950
What about us?

02:39.950 --> 02:42.250
You'll have to wait for now.

02:42.250 --> 02:45.290
You should rest or train.
Just prepare for battle.

02:46.080 --> 02:47.450
Prepare?

02:48.080 --> 02:52.000
Would somebody
just tell me what happened?!

02:55.340 --> 02:56.890
Take us to Romos.

02:56.890 --> 02:57.630
My Lady!

02:58.260 --> 03:02.110
It looks like Princess Leona
is leading the country to take action.

03:02.110 --> 03:04.020
What should we do?

03:04.020 --> 03:05.770
I don't know.

03:05.770 --> 03:10.730
You all haven't fully healed yet.
Rest comes first.

03:10.730 --> 03:11.670
But...

03:11.670 --> 03:15.150
Shut up and obey! I'm off to bed, too.

03:37.300 --> 03:39.260
Ah, that's enough.

03:39.720 --> 03:40.800
Grand Master!

03:40.800 --> 03:43.090
It's time for you to leave the mountain.

03:43.550 --> 03:47.200
Test the results of your training here.

03:47.200 --> 03:48.790
ROMOS KINGDOM
GRAND MARTIAL ARTS TOURNAMENT

03:48.790 --> 03:50.100
This is...!

03:55.690 --> 03:58.860
I'm not myself without this after all.

03:58.860 --> 04:01.030
Your clothes look clean, too.

04:01.490 --> 04:03.820
Merle fixed them for me back in Teran.

04:04.820 --> 04:08.460
<i>She was so demure when we left.</i>

04:08.460 --> 04:11.410
<i>She took really good care of us.</i>

04:12.500 --> 04:15.130
I wonder if she has a thing for me?

04:16.500 --> 04:17.590
As if!

04:18.710 --> 04:23.260
<i>He's so dense when it comes to
girls he's not interested in.</i>

04:23.260 --> 04:25.030
<i>What a waste.</i>

04:25.030 --> 04:28.560
Okay, Mentor! Let's start my training!

04:28.560 --> 04:32.770
With my powered-up spells,
I'll blow away...

04:35.190 --> 04:38.130
So he finally managed to do it.

04:38.130 --> 04:39.070
Huh?

04:39.520 --> 04:41.870
We'll train later.

04:41.870 --> 04:43.780
Go check it out.

04:48.580 --> 04:49.490
Dai!

04:49.950 --> 04:53.460
You actually learned to cast
Zapple by yourself?!

04:53.460 --> 04:58.000
Yeah! I can do it any time
without the power of my crest!

04:58.540 --> 04:59.460
Check it out!

05:06.340 --> 05:07.930
Zapple!

05:11.470 --> 05:13.330
Whoa! Awesome!

05:13.330 --> 05:16.860
Indeed. You've grown strong, Dai!

05:16.860 --> 05:21.270
That's nothing compared
to his real power, old man.

05:21.860 --> 05:25.090
Dai! Now try using
the power of your crest!

05:26.200 --> 05:29.370
Oh! The power of the Dragon Knight?!

05:29.370 --> 05:30.830
Wait right there!

05:34.830 --> 05:35.880
What's this?

05:35.880 --> 05:38.040
A gift from the princess.

05:38.540 --> 05:44.920
No weapon or armour can endure
the full power of a Dragon Knight,

05:45.420 --> 05:49.680
but these clothes have been made with
special Papnican cloth and technique.

05:49.680 --> 05:51.260
They should be fine!

05:53.720 --> 05:54.720
Huh?

05:58.350 --> 06:02.820
The Knife of Papnica!
I thought it burned up!

06:03.190 --> 06:05.740
There are three Knives of Papnica.

06:06.570 --> 06:10.160
<i>The one the princess had
and gave to you was the Sun Knife.</i>

06:10.160 --> 06:13.330
<i>The one right here is the Wind Knife.</i>

06:13.740 --> 06:17.340
Yeah, the other one had a red gem.

06:17.340 --> 06:18.870
This one's is green.

06:19.790 --> 06:24.590
The Sea Knife has been lost,
so take care of this one!

06:24.590 --> 06:28.390
You can't use it when you're using
the power of your crest!

06:28.390 --> 06:29.860
Got it!

06:29.860 --> 06:33.180
Good. Now try them on!

06:42.360 --> 06:43.480
Ooh!

06:48.650 --> 06:49.620
Huh.

06:49.620 --> 06:53.030
Oh! A perfect fit! You look good in them!

06:55.120 --> 06:59.830
Dai, the princess is currently
working on something big.

07:00.500 --> 07:02.550
Since she can't help in person,

07:02.550 --> 07:06.800
she felt that giving you this equipment
was the least she could do.

07:08.380 --> 07:10.800
Leona, thank you!

07:11.300 --> 07:13.930
Okay! Then let's begin!

07:20.230 --> 07:21.060
Crocodine!

07:21.480 --> 07:22.500
Right!

07:29.070 --> 07:33.110
Wow! The power of the crest
even lets him cast Levizoom!

07:39.830 --> 07:41.020
That's fast!

07:41.020 --> 07:43.980
This is great! It feels so light!

07:43.980 --> 07:46.750
Then what about this?

07:48.340 --> 07:51.220
Beast King Redemption Blast!

07:52.680 --> 07:54.470
Draconic Aura!

08:01.310 --> 08:02.480
He withstood it?!

08:03.810 --> 08:07.190
Well done. Even my most powerful attack...

08:08.820 --> 08:09.530
Huh?!

08:10.210 --> 08:11.120
Dai!

08:11.120 --> 08:12.030
Dai!

08:24.460 --> 08:28.720
That scared me.
He suddenly fell out of the sky.

08:28.720 --> 08:34.470
We thought Dai's power of the crest
was invincible, but it has a weakness.

08:35.840 --> 08:42.040
With all of his Aura focused in his fist,
his energy gets drained rapidly.

08:42.040 --> 08:47.630
If you can't control your energy use,
you won't be able to fight long battles.

08:47.630 --> 08:50.170
That's not its only weakness.

08:50.170 --> 08:51.230
Huh?

08:52.240 --> 08:53.990
You can't use weapons.

08:55.340 --> 08:58.540
Your fists will be enough
for a normal enemy,

08:58.540 --> 09:02.810
but not against a powerful one like Baran.

09:02.810 --> 09:03.710
Dammit!

09:05.520 --> 09:09.380
<i>Maybe if you had a sword
like Baran's Demon Dragon Blade.</i>

09:10.750 --> 09:15.950
Is the Demon Dragon Blade really
the only weapon a Dragon Knight can use?

09:15.950 --> 09:19.640
I'm sure that's not true.
The world's a big place.

09:19.640 --> 09:22.980
I'm sure there are other
amazing weapons out there.

09:22.980 --> 09:27.030
For example,
the famous Sword of Champions.

09:27.030 --> 09:28.400
The Sword of Champions?

09:28.400 --> 09:30.170
That's just a legend.

09:30.170 --> 09:31.780
No, it's not!

09:31.780 --> 09:34.470
At the Martial Arts Tournament in Romos...

09:34.470 --> 09:36.130
Martial Arts Tournament?

09:36.130 --> 09:40.680
...the prize for the winner
is the Sword of Champions!

09:40.680 --> 09:42.370
What?!

09:42.370 --> 09:44.880
-Is that true?! Is it?! Is it?!
-Really?! Is it?!

09:44.880 --> 09:49.900
It's true! Amy told me
when she came back from Romos!

09:49.900 --> 09:51.340
That's it!

09:52.650 --> 09:54.320
The Sword of Champions?

09:54.320 --> 09:56.640
It's the prize for the tournament, right?

09:56.640 --> 09:58.140
Oh, that.

09:58.140 --> 10:01.810
I met King Romos
on orders from the princess.

10:02.620 --> 10:08.500
ROMOS KINGDOM
GRAND MARTIAL ARTS TOURNAMENT

10:02.890 --> 10:05.730
He wants to gather
strong warriors to fight the Dark Army,

10:05.730 --> 10:08.500
so he's holding a Martial Arts Tournament.

10:08.500 --> 10:09.940
Ooh!

10:09.940 --> 10:13.070
Any fighting style is allowed
as well as weapons.

10:13.690 --> 10:18.300
The winner will receive the legendary
Sword of Champions.

10:18.300 --> 10:19.680
It's true!

10:19.680 --> 10:21.250
When's the tournament?!

10:21.250 --> 10:22.100
Today.

10:22.100 --> 10:23.470
Today?!

10:23.470 --> 10:25.130
The preliminary fights begin at noon.

10:25.130 --> 10:27.500
Noon?! There's still time!

10:27.500 --> 10:28.580
Where is it?!

10:29.040 --> 10:32.840
At a Colosseum built
a short distance from Romos Castle.

10:32.840 --> 10:34.970
We can reach the castle with Zoom!

10:34.970 --> 10:36.050
We should hurry!

10:37.010 --> 10:37.900
Zoom!

10:40.050 --> 10:41.340
Wait!

10:45.680 --> 10:46.520
Mister!

10:46.580 --> 10:47.770
You!

10:47.770 --> 10:49.040
The Hero!

10:49.040 --> 10:51.280
Where's the Martial Arts Tournament?!

10:51.280 --> 10:53.820
S-Straight down that road!

10:53.820 --> 10:55.670
Down the path to the right!

10:55.670 --> 10:56.690
-Thank you!
-Thanks!

10:57.030 --> 10:58.920
We just might make it!

10:58.920 --> 11:02.340
Let's win this thing
and get the Sword of Champions!

11:02.340 --> 11:04.330
Yeah!

11:07.980 --> 11:10.560
MAGIC BULLET GUN

11:12.980 --> 11:15.570
CRACKLE
ICE-TYPE SPELL

11:16.630 --> 11:23.270
Oh my. I thought they ran off in a hurry.
So they already went to Romos.

11:23.270 --> 11:26.260
It's probably better than
waiting around here.

11:26.680 --> 11:31.960
Lady Amy, what big thing
is Princess Leona planning?

11:31.960 --> 11:35.020
I'm not at liberty
to discuss that right now.

11:35.360 --> 11:39.740
But not only have
the Papnica Troika been deployed,

11:39.740 --> 11:45.350
but the princess herself is traveling
the world in preparation.

11:45.350 --> 11:46.660
I see.

11:46.990 --> 11:50.090
Crocodine, what are your plans?

11:50.090 --> 11:54.550
For now, I'm hoping Baduck
can repair my weapon.

11:54.550 --> 11:57.340
Then I apologize for this, but...

11:58.000 --> 11:59.820
I'm leaving to train.

11:59.820 --> 12:01.360
To train?

12:01.360 --> 12:04.820
The battle with Baran taught me something.

12:04.820 --> 12:10.150
When powerful individuals
fight each other at full strength,

12:10.150 --> 12:12.850
the battle becomes truly horrific.

12:14.650 --> 12:18.400
<i>As a Dragonoid,
Baran couldn't control his power.</i>

12:19.050 --> 12:23.990
<i>It turned him into a monster
capable of killing his own son, Dai.</i>

12:25.820 --> 12:31.410
I used to believe all I had to do
was defeat my enemy, but I was wrong.

12:32.290 --> 12:35.920
The power to fight and win isn't enough.

12:40.000 --> 12:45.430
Now that I've been given this Dark Armour
Spear, I must live up to Larhart's will.

12:45.430 --> 12:50.700
To do that, I must gain the power
to stop even one like Baran.

12:50.700 --> 12:53.120
But how will you train?

12:53.120 --> 12:56.690
I don't have that much experience
with a spear.

12:57.520 --> 13:02.650
But the Book of Avan contains the secrets
of the Avan Style Spear Technique.

13:03.070 --> 13:07.120
So Avan was a master of the spear as well?

13:07.530 --> 13:10.330
He said he was a master
of all fighting styles.

13:11.160 --> 13:15.210
I must master
the Avan Style Spear Technique

13:15.620 --> 13:18.920
and learn to use this Dark Armour Spear.

13:19.340 --> 13:22.510
Wait! Shouldn't you
take the Book of Avan?!

13:22.510 --> 13:25.340
There's no need.
I've read enough to memorize it.

13:25.680 --> 13:29.770
Besides, it's a little too precious
for me to take.

13:29.770 --> 13:31.850
Dai and Popp should have it.

13:31.850 --> 13:32.770
Hyunckel...

13:34.520 --> 13:35.960
Take care of things for me.

13:36.730 --> 13:40.460
Got it. Leave Dai and Papnica to me.

13:40.460 --> 13:43.280
He's always so hard on himself.

13:43.940 --> 13:51.080
He's begun to realize his responsibility
as the eldest Disciple of Avan.

13:52.870 --> 13:56.730
Do you think Dai will be able to win
the Sword of Champions?

13:56.730 --> 13:59.190
Oh? This says...

13:59.190 --> 14:00.960
We're too late?!

14:01.420 --> 14:06.170
The preliminary fights begin at noon,
but registration ends an hour before.

14:08.050 --> 14:12.220
Can't you do something?!
We came all the way from Papnica!

14:13.470 --> 14:16.500
I know it's a request from the Hero...

14:16.500 --> 14:18.390
And I'd like to do something...

14:19.350 --> 14:20.630
But rules are rules.

14:20.630 --> 14:22.360
Oh, come on!

14:24.190 --> 14:26.800
<i>The preliminary fights are starting.</i>

14:26.800 --> 14:28.090
It's about to start!

14:28.090 --> 14:30.330
I wonder who'll be fighting.

14:30.330 --> 14:34.790
Man, what a crock.
What did we waste all that effort for?

14:34.790 --> 14:35.770
Dammit.

14:35.770 --> 14:39.590
How about we challenge the winner
and beat them?

14:39.590 --> 14:42.380
-Is that what Heroes do?
-What do you think?! Well?!

14:42.750 --> 14:47.390
Man, let's go home.
Forget the Sword of Champions.

14:47.390 --> 14:52.830
Why don't we check out the tournament?
We might learn something.

14:52.830 --> 14:54.410
No thanks.

14:54.410 --> 14:59.480
It's a domestic tournament in Romos.
No one interesting will be in it.

15:00.060 --> 15:04.440
Hey! Hurry up!
There's a cute girl fighting!

15:06.320 --> 15:09.320
But we might just learn something.

15:11.200 --> 15:13.320
Wow! Amazing!

15:23.380 --> 15:25.000
Amazing!

15:26.380 --> 15:28.670
Let's see how cute she is.

15:30.260 --> 15:32.180
Why you...!

16:01.290 --> 16:02.590
Oh, wow!

16:02.590 --> 16:04.210
Actually, let's go.

16:04.210 --> 16:08.920
I'd rather not get to know
any girl this freakishly strong.

16:24.270 --> 16:26.520
I heard that, Popp!

16:26.900 --> 16:27.690
Huh?!

16:38.120 --> 16:43.690
<i>Three minutes, 15 seconds!
The Martial Artist Maam wins by knockout!</i>

16:43.690 --> 16:46.480
Oh, wow! That girl really is tough!

16:46.480 --> 16:49.940
<i>The next fight will begin in ten minutes!</i>

16:49.940 --> 16:51.420
Maam!

16:52.550 --> 16:54.510
Dai! Gomechan!

16:56.180 --> 17:00.600
So you entered this Martial Arts
Tournament as a Martial Artist!

17:00.600 --> 17:05.310
That's right! What a surprise!
I didn't expect to run into you here!

17:06.810 --> 17:07.820
Popp?

17:07.820 --> 17:09.610
What's wrong, Popp?

17:10.190 --> 17:14.950
<i>Is it really Maam?
I can't be sure. It could be a fake again.</i>

17:19.950 --> 17:20.790
<i>Okay!</i>

17:20.790 --> 17:22.120
What?

17:22.870 --> 17:23.790
Huh?

17:24.210 --> 17:29.340
The real Maam's eyes should have
a different look from Zaboera's...

17:30.460 --> 17:32.170
What are you doing?!

17:35.840 --> 17:38.180
That slap's the real deal...

17:40.010 --> 17:41.760
Who the hell are you?!

17:47.350 --> 17:48.610
A Fat Rat!

17:48.610 --> 17:49.960
What's it doing here?!

17:49.960 --> 17:54.690
You got a problem?!
The rules don't say a monster can't enter!

17:56.030 --> 17:57.660
A talking Fat Rat!

17:57.660 --> 17:59.240
What the hell are you?!

18:00.740 --> 18:03.120
Ow, ow, ow! What are you doing?!

18:03.120 --> 18:09.000
That's my line! You dare disrespect
Miss Maam, you random pervert!

18:09.500 --> 18:10.480
Wait! I'm not...!

18:10.480 --> 18:12.130
That's enough, Chiu!

18:13.210 --> 18:14.090
Yes, Miss!

18:14.090 --> 18:18.760
I told you about them.
This is Dai, Popp, and Gomechan.

18:18.760 --> 18:22.030
Huh? This is the Hero's party?

18:22.030 --> 18:23.830
No way!

18:23.830 --> 18:25.060
Yes way!

18:25.390 --> 18:29.630
That hurt, you little rat!
I'm gonna roast you on a spit!

18:29.630 --> 18:31.320
Wait, Popp.

18:31.320 --> 18:34.050
He's my senior pupil. Please forgive him.

18:34.050 --> 18:36.590
Senior pupil?! Ratty?!

18:36.590 --> 18:37.530
That's right.

18:38.650 --> 18:42.780
<i>I was trained by Grand Master
Brokeena the Holy Fist.</i>

18:43.950 --> 18:47.960
This is the Karate Rat Chiu
who studied together with me.

18:47.960 --> 18:48.890
Hah!

18:48.890 --> 18:50.420
A Karate Rat?!

18:50.420 --> 18:51.690
Huh.

18:51.690 --> 18:56.180
I see. So you're the Hero Dai
I've heard so much about.

18:56.180 --> 18:59.010
You're smaller than I thought.

18:59.010 --> 19:01.300
Uh, you think so?

19:02.180 --> 19:08.520
<i>The next fight is between the
Wrestler Gomes and the Karate Rat Chiu!</i>

19:08.520 --> 19:11.060
<i>Both fighters enter the ring!</i>

19:12.100 --> 19:15.450
Just sit back and see my strength!

19:15.450 --> 19:19.240
Miss Maam, I'll make quick work of him!

19:20.030 --> 19:26.120
Hey you, pervert Mage!
Let's talk later! Don't go anywhere!

19:27.500 --> 19:29.460
That little...!

19:30.500 --> 19:33.840
Sorry. He's not a bad guy at heart.

19:33.840 --> 19:35.380
What's he like?

19:35.880 --> 19:40.140
He used to be an evil monster
who ravaged a local village.

19:40.140 --> 19:45.100
Grand Master Brokeena captured him
and put him to training.

19:46.010 --> 19:50.440
He gained a strong heart immune
to the Dark Lord's evil will,

19:50.440 --> 19:53.460
and studied to learn to talk.

19:53.460 --> 19:55.490
Brokeena sounds impressive...

19:55.490 --> 19:58.360
So what are you two doing here?

19:58.360 --> 20:01.300
Well, we fought the Dragon Legion.

20:01.300 --> 20:02.380
What?!

20:02.380 --> 20:08.100
<i>Uh oh! We have to explain what happened
gently, or the shock might be a bit much.</i>

20:08.100 --> 20:09.960
It was such an ordeal.

20:09.960 --> 20:11.590
Hey! Dai!

20:11.590 --> 20:14.000
Popp even died once!

20:15.000 --> 20:17.000
Hey! Dai!

20:19.000 --> 20:21.650
Care to explain?

20:21.650 --> 20:24.340
Well... Uh...

20:27.910 --> 20:30.860
Huh? What the hell?

20:30.860 --> 20:34.150
A monster wearing fighting gear?

20:35.860 --> 20:39.210
You don't even know
my real strength, you fool!

20:39.210 --> 20:40.990
What did you say?!

20:41.860 --> 20:45.660
If I can defeat this thug
and show off how cool I am,

20:45.660 --> 20:49.410
Miss Maam's heart will be mine!

20:52.870 --> 20:55.550
So that's why you need
the Sword of Champions.

20:55.550 --> 20:58.710
Yeah. If you win this...

21:00.880 --> 21:04.740
Even if I win, I won't accept
the Sword of Champions.

21:04.740 --> 21:05.930
Huh?!

21:07.180 --> 21:10.930
I can't help you kill your own father!

21:12.810 --> 21:14.020
Maam...

21:14.810 --> 21:16.400
But...

21:22.940 --> 21:27.720
Hmm. This appears to be
quite a success, Mister Zamza.

21:27.720 --> 21:32.000
Yes. And it's all thanks to you,
Your Majesty.

21:32.000 --> 21:34.880
No, no. Gathering strong fighters

21:34.880 --> 21:39.500
to increase our country's strength
was your idea. I merely agreed to it.

21:40.130 --> 21:43.110
Let us hope we gather many of them.

21:43.110 --> 21:46.680
Of course, Your Majesty.

21:52.260 --> 21:55.810
That is our goal after all.

22:04.280 --> 22:07.240
<i>Even if you face the devil
With logic on your side</i>

22:04.380 --> 22:07.340
<i>tatoe akuma ni seiron kazashite
mukatte mitemo</i>

22:07.400 --> 22:11.200
<i>It may just be a rationalization</i>

22:07.510 --> 22:11.310
<i>sore wa akumade seitouka
sashite chigai wa naikamo</i>

22:11.370 --> 22:15.290
<i>Even now, even now I waver</i>

22:11.470 --> 22:15.390
<i>ima mo ima mo yureteiru kedo</i>

22:15.450 --> 22:19.330
<i>How far will we go?</i>

22:15.560 --> 22:19.440
<i>bokura wa dokomade yukuno</i>

22:19.500 --> 22:22.630
<i>I heard a voice like an angel's whisper</i>

22:19.610 --> 22:22.730
<i>tenshi no sasayaki nimo nita
koe ga kikoeta</i>

22:22.800 --> 22:26.550
<i>Maybe it was an imposter's illusion
It still rang in my ears</i>

22:22.900 --> 22:26.650
<i>hatamata petenshi no mayakashi
hitokiwa mimi ni hibiiteita</i>

22:26.720 --> 22:30.260
<i>Exposed to love and sorrow</i>

22:26.820 --> 22:30.370
<i>ai ni hiai ni sarasare nagara</i>

22:30.430 --> 22:34.560
<i>On the path strewn with pride</i>

22:30.530 --> 22:34.660
<i>hokori mamire michi no tochu</i>

22:36.270 --> 22:38.600
<i>Fleeting moments of cowardice</i>

22:36.370 --> 22:38.710
<i>kiete wa ukabu touhikou</i>

22:40.150 --> 22:42.400
<i>The SOS I held back</i>

22:40.250 --> 22:42.500
<i>nomikonda SOS</i>

22:43.980 --> 22:47.990
<i>I clenched my trembling fist</i>

22:44.090 --> 22:48.090
<i>furueru te wo nigirishimeta</i>

22:48.570 --> 22:53.580
<i>That single little promise</i>

22:48.680 --> 22:53.680
<i>tatta hitotsu no chiisana yakusoku ga</i>

22:53.740 --> 22:57.370
<i>Those trivial little memories</i>

22:53.850 --> 22:57.480
<i>honno sasaina omoidetachi ga</i>

22:57.540 --> 22:59.670
<i>They're still in my heart</i>

22:57.640 --> 22:59.770
<i>itsumade tattemo kono mune wo</i>

22:59.830 --> 23:03.840
<i>As embers that keep me burning</i>

22:59.940 --> 23:03.940
<i>kogashi tsuzukeru tomoshibi ni naru</i>

23:04.000 --> 23:08.340
<i>A single transparent beam of light</i>

23:04.110 --> 23:08.450
<i>tada hitosuji no toumei na hikari ga</i>

23:08.510 --> 23:11.510
<i>Lights the way before me</i>

23:08.610 --> 23:11.620
<i>me no mae wo terashite yuku</i>

23:11.680 --> 23:16.180
<i>There is little that I can do</i>

23:11.780 --> 23:16.290
<i>boku ni dekiru koto wa ikutsu mo naisa</i>

23:16.350 --> 23:22.400
<i>Just keep on to the future
I managed to grasp through my faith</i>

23:16.450 --> 23:22.500
<i>shinjinuita saki ni te ni shita mirai wo
susunde yuke</i>

23:33.990 --> 23:38.060
<i>Dai and Popp rejoice at their reunion
with the Martial Artist, Maam.</i>

23:38.060 --> 23:41.940
<i>Leaving the tournament and
the Sword of Champions to Maam,</i>

23:41.940 --> 23:44.840
<i>they watch over the battle
in anticipation.</i>

23:45.250 --> 23:47.820
<i>The tournament moves on to the finals,</i>

23:47.820 --> 23:52.380
<i>but behind the scenes,
an unknown plot begins to take motion.</i>

23:52.890 --> 23:55.100
DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai<i>,</i>

23:55.100 --> 23:56.890
<i>"The Incident at the Finals"</i>

23:56.890 --> 23:59.060
<i>The adventure continues!</i>

23:59.060 --> 24:01.060


24:01.170 --> 24:03.160

